  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">动态树木</a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">超多生物群系</a></span></h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/918/257/biomesoplenty.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1176\" height=\"480\"></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/A4FCBS3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Prkr13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>概述</strong></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">动态树木模组让原版树木变得美丽、复杂且逼真。它对原版树木的改进如此之大，以至于相比之下其他模组的树木显得不够美观。我制作这个模组是为了将超多生物群系中的树木替换为动态版本，使它们与动态树木模组的树木搭配时不会显得格格不入。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>特性</strong></strong></h2><h4><strong>新增树木：</strong></h4><ul>\n<li>棕榈树</li>\n<li>橙色秋树</li>\n<li>黄色秋树</li>\n<li>枫树</li>\n<li>枯萎树木</li>\n<li>枯死树木</li>\n<li>烧焦树木</li>\n<li>开花橡树</li>\n<li>蓝花楹</li>\n<li>彩虹桦树</li>\n<li>粉色樱花树</li>\n<li>白色樱花树</li>\n<li>地狱树皮树</li>\n<li>柳树</li>\n<li>冷杉</li>\n<li>桃花心木</li>\n<li>红杉</li>\n<li>暗影树</li>\n<li>魔法树</li>\n<li>暗黑杨树</li>\n<li>云杉杨树</li>\n</ul><h4><strong>新增蘑菇（如果安装了<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictreesplus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">动态树木+</a>）：</strong></h4><ul>\n<li>毒蝇伞</li>\n<li>发光蘑菇</li>\n</ul><h4><strong>不会被替换的树木：</strong></h4><h5>(1.21.1)</h5><ul>\n<li>起源橡树（经典外观）</li>\n<li>天界树木（过于复杂，无法适配动态树木）</li>\n</ul><h5>(1.16.5)</h5><ul>\n<li>起源橡树（经典外观）</li>\n<li>红树林（无红树木材）</li>\n</ul><h5>(1.12.2)</h5><ul>\n<li>起源橡树（经典外观）</li>\n<li>神圣橡树（体型过大）</li>\n<li>巨型花朵（非树木）</li>\n</ul><h4><strong>兼容模组</strong></h4><p><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>这些模组的特性与超多生物群系的动态树木搭配良好，兼容性显著或已明确提供支持。</p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/better-foliage\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的树叶</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/dynamic-surroundings\" rel=\"nofollow\">动态环境</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/exotic-birds\" rel=\"nofollow\">异域鸟类</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/tumbleweed\" rel=\"nofollow\">风滚草</a></span></span>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>配置</strong></strong></h2>\n</li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">本模组有一个配置文件，允许启用或禁用以下特性：</span></p><h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\">(1.12.2)</span></h5><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">柿子树（若启用，世界生成时将生成柿子树，且秋树、枫树和枯树不会掉落柿子）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">桃树（若启用，世界生成时将生成桃树，且开花树、蓝花楹和桃花心木不会掉落桃子）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">梨树（若启用，世界生成时将生成梨树，且红树林和柳树不会掉落梨子）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">杨树种子（若启用，杨树变种将掉落自己的种子，可在树林生物群系外种植）</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>其他扩展</strong></strong></h2><p>其他模组的动态树木扩展可在<a href=\"https://github.com/DynamicTreesTeam/DynamicTrees/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">动态树木维基</a>中找到。</p><h4><strong>建议与请求：</strong></h4><p>如需请求新模组兼容性，请在此处提交！：<br><a href=\"https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>需求</strong></strong></h2><p>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">动态树木<br></a>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">超多生物群系</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>许可与整合包</strong></h2><p>欢迎在任何整合包中包含此模组，无需申请许可。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>如有任何疑问，请在<a href=\"https://discord.gg/MZ56Cuc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>上向我提问。</strong></span></p>",
